This is Idrasilia, the mirror of the Tree of Life!

The roots of the Tree of Life are under attack by the same evil flames that struck the sacred land of Eldoria.
Its sacred petals scattered across the continent, awakening the Cruel Birch. It began absorbing the energy of the petals and the Essences of Spring held by the Rakoo, who, confused, fell under the Birch's command.

Collect the Idrasera Petals by facing the Cruel Birch and its army in the Spring Dungeon, and take them to Branwen so she can create the Sap of Life.

Bring the Sap of Life and save the Tree of Life.
For each sap you bring, you will be rewarded.
